{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/984461-high-end-bodyguards-made-with-life-up-to-9","id":984461,"title":"High end bodyguards made with life up to 9","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-09T09:31:02-07:00","id":984461,"title":"High end bodyguards made with life up to 9","content":"Hello All,<br /> <br /> So we are playing a very high end open WOD game. Some are 5th gen methuslahs and such..I chose mage and went life 9. I want to create some kind of hell hounds from the show Supernatural...or maybe using the shifter creation one, make some muggles that trasnform and roll out. Any ideas? Spiirit 4, life 9, correspondance 9 (demons are funny at high levels),, matter 4, prime 5, mind 5, time 1, forces 1. I know prime 2 could make them aggro damage but I want a beefy protection too, even though I cant techincally die by anything except other other life 9 and other pattern destroying things (nexus crawlers and the like). Any ideas for creations or any book I can be pointed too?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1552-asssassin","name":"Asssassin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T09:32:07-07:00","id":984462,"title":"","content":"~edit oh and of course arete 10. Im also a black spiral kinfolk. thats why the deal with the bane &quot;demon&quot; was ok in my views.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1552-asssassin","name":"Asssassin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T11:30:49-07:00","id":984523,"title":"","content":"Am I asking the impossible? Is this like GM regulation territory?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1552-asssassin","name":"Asssassin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T13:26:21-07:00","id":984575,"title":"","content":"It depends a bit on which books you're using.<br /> <br /> But if you're playing with Masters of the Art and are at multiple Spheres at 9, with Arete 10? There's extremely little beyond your character's abilities. Corr 9/Life 9 in MotA means your character is nearly immune to harm, and can create an army of copies of themselves anywhere in existence they want. Bodyguards are pretty much irrelevant.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T14:04:47-07:00","id":984590,"title":"","content":"Yeah I mean: why bodyguards?<br /> <br /> With Life 9 you are immortal, you can't die,sure you can't even probably live on Earth, but hey, unless you meet and Antedeluvian or an Oracle you cannot be harmed by anything.<br /> <br /> From Master of the Arts<br /> <br /> Life 9<br /> <br /> &quot;A mage who reaches this level of perfection is functionally immortal.&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","user":"Undead rabbit","date":". 10-09-2016, 05:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T16:04:51-07:00","id":984638,"title":"","content":"Hellhounds are lightyears behind your level of power. Here's the sort of thing you could do.<ul><li>Create a new spatial realm (Correspondence 6). You can bring along parts of other spaces as you like, so no worries about the vacuum of space and such; you can also separate it from surrounding space such that only those with similar archmastery of Correspondence can ever potentially reach you there (Correspondence 8). You are now impossible to attack - how could anyone ever reach you?</li> <li>Create the Copy Virus. It is a self-replicating Life effect that you start from a creature you create wherever you like from wherever you like (Correspondence 9). The creature is a shapeshifter who can shift between your form (becoming a colocation of you, with all your abilities) and any other forms you like. Let's say you want to conquer reality so give it a war-form; it can turn into an enormous dragon that breathes fire, flies, and is made out of living diamond (Matter 4). The effect travels from person to person like a virus; new infected have their mind slowly overwritten as you please (Mind 5), becoming a sleeper agent. You can &quot;seed&quot; this as much as you like, so soon every human will be infected, even if some supernaturals will resist. See how cool Mr. Fifth Gen Vampire is when the kine he's feeding on turns into a dragon.</li> <li>Oh, and if anyone hides out in a bunker away from your new secretly draconic humanity, remotely change the meta-pattern of Life in that area to make them unable to breathe oxygen, or keep their blood in their bodies (Life 7). Since this isn't an attack on their Pattern but rather a change to the environment they're in, you don't have to roll more successes than God. And if they aren't affected by Life (e.g., they're mega-wraiths), just disconnect the space they're occupying from all spaces it neighbors and replace the features of that completely isolated space with whatever's inimical to their existence (Correspondence 8).</li> </ul><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7356,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7356-haldir2012","user":"haldir2012","date":". 10-09-2016, 11:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7356-haldir2012","name":"haldir2012","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"148"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T19:58:20-07:00","id":984723,"title":"","content":"Well in order to balance things a bit, I regenerate fully once per round right before I take my action. No pattern damage can kill me per say...but an ex nihlio type abyss mysticism attack could obliterate me, or another life 9 effect could undo my link, or a nexus crawler could do its fuck with the immediate area effect and undo me that way by &quot;writing' me out. This way I can exist on earth with the rest of the coterie (although the healing effect does give me permadox 9, as it should). So there is balances in place to not make me a meta god. I don't want to fuck over the story, so I'm trying to just make it harder and give myself a defense army just incase one of those things does try to unmake me. Also with co location and such, I think your avatar sticks with the primary, so those other ones would be SOL. Also to that effect I don't want to create a plane and run the fuck away or shatter the masquerade, concensus...etc. Sure skirmishes may break out and random pop ups happen, but I don't want to shatter the game No gay out clause if you will.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1552-asssassin","name":"Asssassin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T20:04:06-07:00","id":984726,"title":"","content":"And yes Masters of the Art for arch spheres, m20 for reg spheres, and old rules for paradox. Oh, also another way I can undo myself, with to much paradox just removing my mage abilities and I get instagibbed (granted that would be at like 25 + paradox, but I'm just saying)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1552-asssassin","name":"Asssassin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T23:39:54-07:00","id":984767,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asssassin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/984461-high-end-bodyguards-made-with-life-up-to-9?p=984726#post984726\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And yes Masters of the Art for arch spheres, m20 for reg spheres, and old rules for paradox. Oh, also another way I can undo myself, with to much paradox just removing my mage abilities and I get instagibbed (granted that would be at like 25 + paradox, but I'm just saying)</div> </div> </div> </div>With Prime 5 you can cancel Paradox, if you have enough quint.<br /> <br /> Of course your avatar sticks with you, and the copy has none. But with enough correspondence that point is moot. But of course just 1 effect per round.<br /> <br /> For Bodyguards I recommend strong humans and animals. Stay coincidental on these. <br /> With Arete 10 you can spare 1 success for LOS correspondence range.<br /> <br /> Your bodyguards guard a decoy.<br /> Effects on your decoy are at range 0, effects on things your decoy senses are range 1.<br /> <br /> Your original body stays in a inaccessible(but through arch-correspondence) spatial realm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T15:49:19-07:00","id":985107,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nonsense</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/984461-high-end-bodyguards-made-with-life-up-to-9?p=984767#post984767\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> With Prime 5 you can cancel Paradox, if you have enough quint.<br /> <br /> Of course your avatar sticks with you, and the copy has none. But with enough correspondence that point is moot. But of course just 1 effect per round.<br /> <br /> For Bodyguards I recommend strong humans and animals. Stay coincidental on these.<br /> With Arete 10 you can spare 1 success for LOS correspondence range.<br /> <br /> Your bodyguards guard a decoy.<br /> Effects on your decoy are at range 0, effects on things your decoy senses are range 1.<br /> <br /> Your original body stays in a inaccessible(but through arch-correspondence) spatial realm.</div> </div> </div> </div>Now that's a good idea....I could even lose the regen permadox. Doesn't creating clones create paradox though? And wouldn't they fade after such and such time?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1552-asssassin","name":"Asssassin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T22:12:46-07:00","id":985269,"title":"","content":"That is debatable (if you use the non archsphere rote, archspheres are always vulgar on earth per Masters of the Art).<br /> <br /> Regarding the duration:<br /> Get enough successes to last a story or longer.<br /> <br /> Swap them out with a fresh one.<br /> <br /> Does it really matter when they fade? For all the others know you teleported/turned invisible.<br /> You send a new one, if it suits you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}